{
  "_comment": [
    "TWO SEPARATE CATALOGUES - verified against both on 2026-08-20:",
    "",
    "  restApi[]  - what the API key can generate. GET /models returns 13 models",
    "               with base_credits. Estimates: POST /estimate/{slug}.",
    "               Auth: 'Authorization: Key {id}:{secret}'.",
    "               THIS IS WHAT src/ SPENDS AGAINST.",
    "",
    "  video[]/image[] - the MCP connector catalogue (Kling, Veo, Seedance,",
    "               Nano Banana...). Far larger, but only reachable through",
    "               Claude's MCP tools, not the REST key.",
    "",
    "costCredits is null until measured. Resolution order at runtime:",
    "  1. POST /estimate/{slug} (exact, authoritative)",
    "  2. learned cost for an identical config (measured balance delta)",
    "  3. costCredits below (measured previously, settings unknown)",
    "  4. refuse - never guess",
    "A null costCredits NEVER becomes a silent assumption. See src/budget/cost.ts."
  ],

  "restApi": {
    "_comment": [
      "Live catalogue from GET /models. base_credits is the API's own figure.",
      "dop = image2video, soul/popcorn = text2image.",
      "Video estimates require image_url in the body, so a reference image must",
      "exist before a video can be quoted - which the pipeline does anyway."
    ],
    "verifiedAt": "2026-08-20",
    "authHeader": "Authorization: Key {HIGGSFIELD_API_KEY}:{HIGGSFIELD_API_SECRET}",
    "estimatePath": "/estimate/{slug}",
    "models": [
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/dop/lite", "baseCredits": 2.0, "op": "image2video", "output": "video" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/dop/lite/first-last-frame", "baseCredits": 2.0, "op": "image2video", "output": "video", "supportsStartEndFrames": true },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/dop/turbo", "baseCredits": 6.5, "op": "image2video", "output": "video" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/dop/turbo/first-last-frame", "baseCredits": 6.5, "op": "image2video", "output": "video", "supportsStartEndFrames": true },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/dop/standard", "baseCredits": 9.0, "op": "image2video", "output": "video" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/dop/standard/first-last-frame", "baseCredits": 9.0, "op": "image2video", "output": "video", "supportsStartEndFrames": true },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/soul/standard", "baseCredits": 1.0, "op": "text2image", "output": "image", "quotedCredits": 1.5, "quotedUsd": 0.094 },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/soul/character", "baseCredits": 1.0, "op": "text2image", "output": "image" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/soul/reference", "baseCredits": 1.0, "op": "text2image", "output": "image" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/soul/cinema", "baseCredits": 0.0, "op": "text2image", "output": "image" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/soul/v2/standard", "baseCredits": 0.0, "op": "text2image", "output": "image" },
      { "slug": "higgsfield-ai/popcorn/auto", "baseCredits": 1.472, "op": "text2image", "output": "image" },
      { "slug": "soul-id", "baseCredits": 40.0, "op": "character", "output": "image" }
    ],
    "selectionPolicy": {
      "supporting": "higgsfield-ai/dop/lite",
      "normal": "higgsfield-ai/dop/turbo",
      "anchor": "higgsfield-ai/dop/standard",
